format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: npc-ray

node chat-ray-up-counter
kind: unprompted
pose: think
trigger: lessons_completed:14
title: The counter reads something

    I'm in my kitchen.

    No source here. Hand-held counter's on the table. It shows a reading.

    Not zero. A small number.

reply: is it broken? -> chat-ray-cnt-broken
reply: is there a hidden source? -> chat-ray-cnt-hidden
reply: it's background, right? -> chat-ray-cnt-bg

node chat-ray-cnt-broken
kind: reply
pose: sorry

    No. I checked it. Twice.

    A working detector picks up radiation. A little is always around. So a small reading is expected.

reply: so what is it picking up? -> chat-ray-cnt-what
reply: ok, not broken -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-hidden
kind: reply
pose: explain

    No hidden source. I looked.

    Background radiation is present on Earth at all times. Mostly natural minerals in the ground, soil and water. Plus cosmic radiation from space.

reply: even in a kitchen? -> chat-ray-cnt-what
reply: ok -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-bg
kind: reply
pose: proud

    Right. Noted.

    Always there. Varies from place to place on Earth. So the reading varies too.

reply: so zero is wrong? -> chat-ray-cnt-zero
reply: cool -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-what
kind: reply
pose: point

    Minerals in the ground. Cosmic radiation. A little from the food and from me.

    That's the short list. Nothing here is a source anyone would call a source.

reply: so why use a counter at all? -> chat-ray-cnt-use
reply: good to know -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-zero
kind: reply
pose: explain

    In an ordinary room, a working detector shouldn't read exactly zero.

    If it does, check the batteries.

reply: ha, noted -> chat-ray-cnt-end
reply: good tip -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-use
kind: reply
pose: think

    To tell the usual level from something higher.

    You need to know the normal reading before you can say a reading is unusual. Measure the background first. Then compare.

react: clap -> chat-ray-cnt-end
react: think -> chat-ray-cnt-end

node chat-ray-cnt-end
kind: sign_off
pose: greet

    Counter's staying on the table. Small number, small mystery.

    Checked off.
